@base = http://localhost:5126
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Transfer 1,000 €: TransferCompleted is published, Bob is notified, an alert is raised
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 1000 }

### Bob, with his notification
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{bob}}

### The compliance alerts
GET {{base}}/compliance/alerts

### Withdraw 100 € (route → Send(Withdraw) → Journal → Validation → UnitOfWork → handler)
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{bob}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Refused by the ValidationBehavior: the handler is never called (400, ValidationProblem)
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{bob}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 0 }

### Refused by the handler: insufficient balance (400)
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{bob}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 99999 }

### What the JournalBehavior recorded: every request, its outcome and its duration
GET {{base}}/journal
